OL,3,ABoy arrested after river deaths
OL,4,Areleased on bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old boy who was arrested
OL,7,Fafter three teenagers died when a car
OL,8,Fentered the River Wear in Sunderland
OL,9,Fhas been released on bail.
OL,11,FSixteen-year-olds Luke Etheridge and
OL,12,FZara Shaw and 17-year-old Jackson Duke
OL,13,Fdied after an Audi A3 came off the road
OL,14,Fat Panns Bank, near Wearmouth Bridge,
OL,15,Fand entered the river just before 13:30
OL,16,FBST on Tuesday.
OL,18,FThe 17-year-old boy was arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,20,Fdriving.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
